# shooter: a shootout in a snowy arena, offline (REQ-DEMO-020).
#
# The script plays the player with input commands (REQ-DEMO-008): `key`
# and `mouse`. The bots use a seeded random number generator on
# the fixed timestep, so each run gives the same fight and the same frames
# (REQ-DEMO-021). A change to the fight or to the arena moves the bots:
# then the turns and the shots below must change too. `set trace on`
# writes the places and the aim angles to the log.
#
# Each caption names the engine feature that shows. The checkpoints hash
# the frames for scripts/demos-check.sh (REQ-DEMO-003).
0 set time 0.37
0 set snow on
0 set clouds on
0 set fog on
0 set shadows on
0 set exposure 0.8
0 set bots_hold on
0 set god off
0 set follow -1
0 set bot_damage 0.2
0 set bot_error 0.06
0 set trace off
